  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute damage to transport, power and payments infrastructure disrupts firms' cash flows and triggers deposit withdrawals, higher loan delinquencies and provisioning, reducing banks' available liquid buffers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
