  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.78</data>
  <data key="d36">A market-implied increase in expected oil-supply risk feeds directly into higher near-term inflation forecasts, prompting market participants to reprice the expected path of central-bank policy tightening and lift short-term policy-rate expectations.</data>
