  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.78</data>
  <data key="d36">Tightened export controls and investment screening block access to critical chips, pre-trained models, and tooling, directly delaying or preventing organizations from deploying new agentic systems that depend on those inputs.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_agent_systemic_risks</data>
