  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter US regulation of technology flows to China (and allied secondary export controls) reduces the availability of advanced semiconductors and sensors that could be diverted to Russia or used to upgrade munitions/targeting, degrading Russian precision strike effectiveness and thus lowering aggregate infrastructure damage over time.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
