  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.72</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising strategic tensions raise the tempo and permissiveness of state and proxy cyber operations (including targeted intrusions and supply‑chain attacks) aimed at degrading or commandeering adversary AI systems, increasing successful exploits.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
