  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in sovereign yields that depress domestic growth and raise debt service costs create political pressure to protect domestic industries, making policymakers more likely to raise tariffs or other trade restrictions against strategic competitors including China.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_bond_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
</edge>
