  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden increase in regulatory scrutiny triggers fines, compliance costs and operational restrictions for AI-intensive firms, worsening near-term cashflows and raising default and liquidity risk premia priced into corporate spreads.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_agent_systemic_risks</data>
